    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a Mediterranean sweet wine | see vinum Malmesey | malmsey, a Mediterranean sweet wine (OED s.v. malmsey) | a Mediterranean sweet wine, originally the product of the neighbourhood of Monemvasia (Napoli di Malvasia) in the Morea (OED s.v. malmsey) (see also vinum) | a Mediterranean sweet wine, originally the product of the neighbourhood of Monemvasia (Napoli di Malvasia) in the Morea (OED s.v. malmsey) | a Mediterranean sweet wine, originally the product of the neighborhood of Monemvasia (Napoli di Malvasia) in the Morea (OED s.v. malmsey) | malmsey, a Mediterranean sweet wine | malmsey, a strong sweet wine, originally the product of the neighbourhood of Monemvasia (Napoli di Malvasia) in the Morea (OED s.v. malmsey)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
